cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the accompanying paper named in the README."
type: software
title: "aharrsim: a transient wellbore-reservoir-plant simulator for geothermal wells"
abstract: "Transient heat-transfer and hydraulics model of geothermal wells (coaxial closed loops, production, injection and U-tube wells), with reservoir elements, well chains and surface plants, used to run one example of each of twenty geothermal development types on a common basis."
authors:
  - family-names: Wrobel
    given-names: Lukasz
    affiliation: Aharr Geothermal
version: "2.4.1"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - geothermal
  - wellbore simulation
  - enhanced geothermal system
  - closed-loop geothermal
  - benchmark
